{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"1a54313f-cc3e-4dd3-b9ea-4fdc565354b9","description":"Find information on claiming tax reliefs and allowances on your Self Assessment tax return.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Tax reliefs you can claim on your Self Assessment tax return include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/seafarers-earnings-deduction-tax-relief-if-you-work-on-a-ship\">Seafarers’ Earnings Deduction</a></li>\n  <li>Community Investment Tax Relief</li>\n  <li>subscriptions for shares under the Enterprise Investment Scheme</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Find out about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/tax-on-your-private-pension/pension-tax-relief\">tax relief on your private pension contributions</a> and whether you need claim it in your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information that can help you complete different sections of your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"the-limit-on-income-tax-reliefs\">The limit on Income Tax reliefs</h3>\n\n<p>Find out about the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">limit on Income Tax reliefs (HS204)</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"tax-reliefs-for-employees\">Tax reliefs for employees</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/seafarers-earnings-deduction-hs205-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Seafarers’ Earnings Deduction (HS205)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/employment-residence-and-domicile-issues-hs211-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Employment, residence and domicile issues (HS211)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"tax-reliefs-on-investments\">Tax reliefs on investments</h3>\n\n<p>Find information on:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/community-investment-tax-relief-hs237-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Community Investment Tax Relief (HS237)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/enterprise-investment-scheme-income-tax-relief-hs341-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Enterprise Investment Scheme — Income Tax relief (HS341)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/seed-enterprise-investment-scheme-income-tax-and-capital-gains-tax-reliefs-hs393-self-assessment-helpsheet\">Seed Enterprise Investment Scheme — Income Tax and Capital Gains Tax reliefs (HS393)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"qualifying-loans-and-alternative-finance-arrangements\">Qualifying loans and alternative finance arrangements</h3>\n\n<p>Find out about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/interest-and-alternative-finance-payments-eligible-for-relief-on-qualifying-loans-and-alternative-finance-arrangements-hs340-self-assessment-helpshee\">tax reliefs on qualifying loans and alternative finance arrangements (HS340)</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-video\">HMRC YouTube video</h2>\n\n<p>Watch a recorded webinar about other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DvYwU6l_w3M\">Other income and tax reliefs on your online tax return</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about tax reliefs and allowances, such as:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>paying into personal pensions</li>\n  <li>blind person’s allowance</li>\n  <li>marriage allowance</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The YouTube webinar about other income and tax reliefs has been updated.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-11T09:23:48Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2025-04-24T23:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-04-25T00:00:00.000+01:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"the-limit-on-income-tax-reliefs","level":3,"text":"The limit on Income Tax reliefs"},{"id":"tax-reliefs-for-employees","level":3,"text":"Tax reliefs for employees"},{"id":"tax-reliefs-on-investments","level":3,"text":"Tax reliefs on investments"},{"id":"qualifying-loans-and-alternative-finance-arrangements","level":3,"text":"Qualifying loans and alternative finance arrangements"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"},{"id":"hmrc-youtube-video","level":2,"text":"HMRC YouTube video"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-04-25T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"1a54313f-cc3e-4dd3-b9ea-4fdc565354b9","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T09:23:48Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Cael help gyda rhyddhadau treth eraill ar eich Ffurflen Dreth Hunanasesiad","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-other-tax-reliefs-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"1a54313f-cc3e-4dd3-b9ea-4fdc565354b9","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T09:23:48Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"